+        description: str = "Reading...",
+    ) -> BinaryIO:
+        """Wrap a binary file object, advancing a task as its bytes are read.
+
+        The wrapped file is owned by the caller and is not closed by the reader.
+        The progress display is not started by this method.
+
+        Args:
+            file (BinaryIO): A binary file-like object to read from.
+            total (int, optional): Total size in bytes. Defaults to the total of task_id, if given.
+            task_id (TaskID, optional): Existing task to update. Default is a new task.
+            description (str, optional): Description of the task, if a new task is created. Defaults to "Reading...".
+
